icode 转义序列 (\\uXXXX)，反之亦然。非常适合 Java、JavaScript 和 CSS 开发中需要正确编码特殊字符的场景。"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":9,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/zh-CN/tools/dev/jwt-debugger","name":"专业 JWT 在线解析调试工具：安全、离线、极速","description":"帮助开发者深度透视 JSON Web Token (JWT) 的 Header 和 Payload 结构。完全本地化解码，确保您的私密验证 Token 不会泄露给第三方服务器。"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":10,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/zh-CN/tools/dev/regex-tester","name":"正则表达式测试","description":"实时编写与调试正则表达式，支持匹配高亮、分组提取及常用修饰符配置。"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":11,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/zh-CN/tools/dev/json-to-ts","name":"专业 JSON 转 TypeScript 接口生成器：类型安全首选","description":"将复杂的 JSON 数据瞬间转换为高质量的 TypeScript 定义。支持深度嵌套推导、智能命名合规以及可选属性自动识别，显著提升前端开发效率。"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":12,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/zh-CN/tools/dev/crypto-symmetric","name":"对称加密 (AES/DES)","description":"AES, DES, RC4 等对称加密与解密工具，支持多种补位与模式配置。"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":13,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/zh-CN/tools/dev/chinese-crypto","name":"SM2/SM3/SM4 国密算法工具 | 加密兼容性测试","description":"在线测试 SM2、SM3、SM4 国密算法相关流程，适合开发阶段进行摘要、加密参数和兼容性检查。"}]}]0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"language":"zh","children":[["$","template",null,{"id":"structured-data-category-developer-tools-zh","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4"]}],["$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"],"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"bYYi-ZPGnf7tmCL1WLFhj"}
